{"productId": "cf7036ef-eaf1-476b-a99a-45d39c556037", "modelName": "X-Bolt Mountain Pro", "modelDescription": "The X-Bolt builds on past Browning rifles and adds numerous improvements that place the X-Bolt at the top. The X-Bolt's new three-lever Feather Trigger provides a clean, crisp pull with no take-up or creep and minimal overtravel. The X-Bolt is free-floated by bedding the front and rear of the action for stability and to help maintain barrel to stock spacing for consistent accuracy. A recessed muzzle crown helps protect the rifling from damage. The Pachmayr Decelerator recoil pad has proprietary construction and material to promote a directional deflection of recoil forces, pulling the stock comb away from your face to reduce felt recoil and muzzle climb. The bolt unlock button works in conjunction with the top-tang safety to provide an added measure of safety during checking and unloading of the chamber.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "11b28c7f-46e3-4502-ab30-a5afb120a1a1", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt Mountain Pro, Bolt Action, 7mm Rem Mag, 26\" Barrel, Burnt Bronze Cerakote, Right Hand, Accent Graphic Black Carbon Fiber Stock, Muzzle Break, 3 Round", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/54d6ca85-2447-4e04-aca6-71eb66b59d97", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c9da1463-d48c-4ea0-85a9-54ab38e3a95f", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c209ef56-0c90-48ff-95f1-393691ab8e7a"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "035538227", "upc": "023614849568", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "3e105ade-7201-49e3-9232-4b92273d4c5c", "attributeName": "Free Floating Barrel", "attributeValueId": "cb319979-7285-4ff4-afed-4926a735631d", "valueName": "Yes"}, {"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "58b272c7-0c5c-40f2-a6f8-b83b1071cc15", "valueName": "Non